://api.github.com/users/RBWaldorff/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RBWaldorff/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-24T17:17:08Z","updated_at":"2025-01-24T17:17:08Z","body":"That's a good implementation! I honestly hadn't noticed that, which is most likely the culprit of my proposal. \r\n\r\nKeeping that in mind, and I'm playing devil's advocate here, I suppose this proposal could help prevent other users from missing that setting, marginally improving UX at the expense of whatever performance hit the addition of a per-material variable would add. \r\n\r\nI get that bloating the **BaseMaterial3D** like this is not in the interest of most, and I totally understand if this doesn't get added. I'm just spitballing an (admittedly flawed) alternative solution to a problem caused by a lack of understanding of the engine and a want for a quick and easy tinker that I rushed without research towards existing fixes to the problem and was a little too eager to share. ","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2613023875/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2613159023","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101988#issuecomment-2613159023","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101988","id":2613159023,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bwaRv","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}